<title>USA: AMEX to trade three new options on June 17.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade three new options on June 17.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Monday it would list options on ContiFinancial Corp, i2 Technologies Inc and Mid Ocean Ltd on June 17.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
